                      <rules>
                        <rule name="Standard Wargear" id="r74-ba-pal-lr-hs-lr-achilles-wg" hidden="false">
                          <description>Quad Launcher with Frag and Shatter Shells; two Twin-linked Multi-Meltas; Extra Armour; Armoured Ceramite; Searchlight and Smoke Launchers. Power of the Machine Spirit; Transport Capacity 6.

Twin-Linked: Re-roll failed To Hit rolls with this weapon. Does not count as two weapons. Twin-linked Template weapons automatically hit all models fully or partially under the Template.</description>
                        </rule>
                        </rules>
